# Waterfall integration patch for the provided PyQt5 + PyQtGraph signal plotter
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This patch adds:
# 1) Waterfall mode based on RPM + acceleration channel selection
# 2) Filter target selection: None / Acceleration / RPM / Both
# 3) 2D waterfall map (Hz vs RPM, color = amplitude/power)
# 4) Draggable order cursors on the 2D waterfall
# 5) Bottom tracking plot: amplitude along each order cursor vs RPM
# 6) Separate real-3D popup using pyqtgraph.opengl.GLSurfacePlotItem
#
# Important design choice:
# GLViewWidget is intentionally kept in a separate dialog because it is not a
# drop-in replacement for your current InteractivePlotWidget architecture.
#
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1) ADD / REPLACE IMPORTS
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------

